Package: ubuntu-user-manager
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: policykit-1, passwd, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Maintainer: Ubuntu User Manager <noreply@local>
Description: Simple GUI for creating and administering local Ubuntu users
 Ubuntu User Manager is a GTK4/Libadwaita desktop application for
 creating, resetting the password of, and deleting local user accounts
 on lab machines, without requiring the operator to use a terminal.
 Administrative operations are authorized through Polkit and performed
 by a separate privileged helper; the graphical interface itself never
 runs as root.
